tssX355wfkUqpJRdwrkw&oe=6A8D6D89"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2643834889078100", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12448944_162446487752374_4171312266970398720_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ua0VZYRMOn0Q7kNvwH8nsp5&_nc_oc=AdrV2rwkOweCJE8EwyRo4Z2Imx7CU8ztExyG9o6Sgax5lNcpqsHI0XMLMCH7qNzcVCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHthKk4uDDDk7sxUaYfMB8zIOgxnC3w1I9sZadJuIfbLA&oe=6A8D6970"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Discovering Space", "keywords": ["space", "exploration", "simulation", "solar", "explore"], "long_description": "* Learn the about some of our close neighbours, through an intensely engaging experience.\n\n* Contemplate the awesomeness and remoteness of space.\n\n\u2026 or just simply enjoy the ride.\n\n\nHighlights:\n\nTake a high orbit around the earth, visit the far side of the Moon. Fly in close to Moon\u2019s surface and understand the formation of lunar features.\n\nSee our fragile home, Earth, from a completely new perspective.\n\nVisit Mars and its companion moons. Fly in low and close over some of Mars\u2019 ancient geological features.\n\nGo deeper into the Solar system; graze upon Jupiter\u2019s swirling clouds and swing around some of its fascinating moons.\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n* High quality 3d real-time rendered visuals for truly immersive feel.\n* True to scale planets and moons.\n* Engaging soundtrack and audio.\n* Three tours, between 5 and 10 minutes each.", "short_description": "A breath-taking space discovery experience through a series of guided and narrated tours."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "DiscoveringVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comf